<item name='OriginalModTime'><datetime dst='true'>20090806T103958,91-04</datetime></item>
<item name='HFText'><text>Yes</text></item>
<item name='HelpECategories'><text>1. User Guide</text></item>
<item name='HelpESubCat'><text>Placing An Order</text></item>
<item name='HelpFCategories'><text>1. Guide d'utilisation</text></item>
<item name='HelpFSubCat'><text>Commander</text></item>
<item name='HelpDocNumber'><number>4</number></item>
<item name='HelpSubCatNumber'><number>1</number></item>
<item name='HelpEHelpText'><richtext>
<pardef id='1' leftmargin='0.8125in' rightmargin='93%'/>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>To generate a financial code, follow these steps below:</run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/></run></par>
<pardef id='2' leftmargin='1.2500in' rightmargin='93%' firstlineleftmargin='1in'/>
<par def='2'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>1.  Click on the "Generate Financial Code" button in the action bar.</run></par>
<pardef id='3' leftmargin='1.2000in' rightmargin='93%' firstlineleftmargin='1in'/>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>2.  Fill in the form in the following order:  </run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Category » Funding Source » G/L Account » Program Activity.</run><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>  For the G/L Account and Program Activity you can use the pull-down arrow </run><picture
 height='15px' width='18px'><gif originalformat='notesbitmap'>
R0lGODlhEgAPAOIAAP///7i4uAAAAHh4eKioqAAAAAAAAAAAACwAAAAAEgAPAEAIXAABCBxIsOBA
AgACJAzAMICAhQwHPBSosKFFixIBIAQgoKPHjx8JXhzJUCDCigxBNsx4EiLJABkNypxJc6bCmgIn
JnRJkuVOix4h+kT5EubDlgOSKl2aVCfOggEBADs=
</gif></picture><run
><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/> and choose from the selections available.  Click once on your selection to highlight it and then click once on OK.</run></par>
<pardef id='4' leftmargin='1.2000in' rightmargin='93%'/>
<par def='4'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>Try to find the G/L Account number that best describes what you are purchasing.  For the Program Activity, you may only have one selection.</run></par>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>3.  Click on "OK" on the right of the Financial Codes window to generate the financial code.  When you are back to the order form the financial coding should look something like: 831503 04007 A220 4320010.  </run><run
><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'
 color='blue'/>If it has a string of zeroes (e.g. 831503 04007 0000 4320101) anywhere in the coding, you have not completed it properly.</run></par>
<par def='3'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='2'><run><font style='bold' name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true'
 familyid='20'/></run></par>
<par def='1'><run><font name='Arial' pitch='variable' truetype='true' familyid='20'/>	</run><picture
